### ========================================
### TEST USER CREATION WITH ROLES
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Login as SUPER_ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Get All Roles (Lấy danh sách roles)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create User with Roles (Tạo user mới với roles)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "newuser@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "Nam",
  "roleIds": [2, 4]
}

### 4. Create User with Single Role (HR_MANAGER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hruser",
  "email": "hruser@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phoneNumber": "0123456789",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "Nữ",
  "roleIds": [2]
}

### 5. Create User with Multiple Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "multiuser",
  "email": "multiuser@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "roleIds": [2, 3, 4]
}

### 6. Create User - Missing Required Fields (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser"
}

### 7. Create User - Invalid Role ID (Should partially succeed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "invalidrole",
  "email": "invalidrole@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "roleIds": [2, 999]
}
